   "key": "temperature.range",
   "why": "The glossary entry quoted on p. 111-112 is headed 'Single-chamber method (not available for freeze-dryers with an LSCbasic control system)'. The -20 °C therefore does not apply to the Alpha 1-4 LSCbasic, and the configuration uses unheated external shelves (double-chamber method)."
  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "martin_christ_alpha_1_4_lscbasic_three_shelves",
   "key": "temperature.base",
   "why": "Rejected for the same reason: the manual says the single-chamber method is not available with the LSCbasic controller."
  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "martin_christ_alpha_1_4_lscbasic_three_shelves",
   "key": "chamber.volume",
   "why": "6.5 L is the ice-condenser chamber volume, not the acrylic drying bell where the samples sit, and the LSCbasic cannot dry inside the condenser chamber. This is a substitution."
  }
